---
import FocusLayout from '../../layouts/FocusLayout.astro';
---

<FocusLayout title='Focus - Conscious App Usage'>
  <div class='min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-b from-red-950/40 via-black to-black'>
    <div class='max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-12 pb-4 md:pt-16 md:pb-8'>
      <div class='flex flex-col items-center text-center'>
        <div class='inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full border border-red-500/30 bg-red-500/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-red-300 mb-6'>
          <span class='h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-red-500 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(239,68,68,0.6)]'></span>
          FOCUS
        </div>
        <h1 class='text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mb-4 tracking-tight'>Focus
        </h1>
        <p class='text-zinc-400 text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-2xl'>
          A standalone Android app with a sharp red-black identity and a single purpose: interrupt autopilot and bring back intention.
        </p>
        <div class='flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 mt-6'>
          <a href='#features' class='inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-500 text-black font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 text-sm transition-colors duration-200 shadow-[0_0_18px_rgba(220,38,38,0.35)]'>See features</a>
          <a href='/focus/privacy' class='inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-zinc-700 text-zinc-200 hover:border-red-400 hover:text-red-300 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm transition-colors duration-200'>Privacy Policy</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id='features' class='max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 md:py-14'>
      <div class='grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3 gap-4'>
        <div class='rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/50 p-5'>
          <p class='text-red-400 font-semibold text-sm mb-2'>Intervention</p>
          <p class='text-white text-lg font-semibold mb-2'>Decide consciously, not automatically</p>
          <p class='text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed'>A standalone Android app with a sharp red-black identity and a single purpose: interrupt autopilot and bring back intention.</p>
        </div>

        <div class='rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/50 p-5'>
          <p class='text-red-400 font-semibold text-sm mb-2'>Rules instead of app killers</p>
          <p class='text-white text-lg font-semibold mb-2'>Stable, mindful, reliable</p>
          <p class='text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed'>Focus uses reactivation rules and conscious allowances instead of aggressive, brittle force-stop promises.</p>
        </div>

        <div class='rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/50 p-5'>
          <p class='text-red-400 font-semibold text-sm mb-2'>Freemium + Premium</p>
          <p class='text-white text-lg font-semibold mb-2'>Free to start, powerful to grow</p>
          <p class='text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed'>Free entry with up to 2 apps and a 3s pause. Premium unlocks unlimited apps, flexible timers, Always-on and themes.</p>
        </div>

        <div class='rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/50 p-5'>
          <p class='text-red-400 font-semibold text-sm mb-2'>Always-on</p>
          <p class='text-white text-lg font-semibold mb-2'>Stay protected</p>
          <p class='text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed'>Premium users can show the overlay on every open or use timed allowances to return to focus later.</p>
        </div>

        <div class='rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/50 p-5'>
          <p class='text-red-400 font-semibold text-sm mb-2'>Statistics</p>
          <p class='text-white text-lg font-semibold mb-2'>See your patterns</p>
          <p class='text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed'>Basic stats are free. Deeper charts and finer insights are part of the premium experience.</p>
        </div>

        <div class='rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/50 p-5'>
          <p class='text-red-400 font-semibold text-sm mb-2'>Own branding</p>
          <p class='text-white text-lg font-semibold mb-2'>Made for Focus users</p>
          <p class='text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed'>Focus is a standalone app with its own identity, red/black UI and a minimal, distraction-free design.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class='max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pb-12 md:pb-20'>
      <div class='rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950/50 p-5 md:p-6'>
        <h2 class='text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-5'>Planned Premium</h2>
        <div class='grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5'>
          <div>
            <p class='text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-widest text-xs font-semibold mb-3'>Free</p>
            <ul class='space-y-2 text-zinc-300 text-sm'>
              <li class='flex items-start gap-2'><span class='mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500'></span>Up to 2 target apps</li>
              <li class='flex items-start gap-2'><span class='mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500'></span>3 second countdown</li>
              <li class='mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500'></span>Basic statistics</li>
              <li class='flex items-start gap-2'><span class='mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500'></span>Standard color theme</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class='text-red-400 uppercase tracking-widest text-xs font-semibold mb-3'>Premium</p>
            <ul class='space-y-2 text-zinc-200 text-sm'>
              <li class='flex items-start gap-2'><span class='mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500'></span>Unlimited target apps</li>
              <li class='flex items-start gap-2'><span class='mt-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500'></span>Flexible countdown times</li>
              <li class='flex items-start gap-2'><span class='mt-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500'></span>Always-on & reactivation rules</li>
              <li class='flex items-start gap-2'><span class='mt-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500'></span>Theme and accent color choice</li>
              <li class='flex items-start gap-2'><span class='mt-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-500'></span>Advanced statistics</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class='mt-6 rounded-xl border border-red-500/20 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-900/20 to-transparent p-4 text-center'>
          <p class='text-zinc-400 text-sm mb-1'>Play Store link coming after public release.</p>
          <p class='text-zinc-500 text-xs'>In the meantime, you can build the APK directly from the project.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</FocusLayout>
